================================================================================
SCOPE
================================================================================

This licence covers:

  - All analysis scripts and code in this repository (scripts/, index.html,
    requirements.txt, README.md, this LICENSE file).
  - The derived metadata catalog distributed as `mena_metagenomics.tsv`,
    `mena_database.{tsv,csv,xlsx,json}`, supplementary tables, harmonisation
    rules, and the interactive web platform.
  - Figures and tables produced from the harmonised catalog.

This licence does NOT cover:

  - Raw sequencing reads or original BioSample / BioProject metadata, which
    remain under the access terms of their respective source repositories
    (NCBI Sequence Read Archive, European Nucleotide Archive). Users
    redistributing raw read data must comply with those repositories'
    policies.

